A||N||32||AusFiero||My Fiero is Flamin Dead||||8||
Z||000000||AusFiero||09-11-2001||03:58 AM||||Well this saddens me no end. My Fiero burnt out today. Here's the story.<BR>I went today to get the stage 2 bodykit plugs from the glass guy because he was snowed under, so I decided to make the moulds at home even though it was going to stink the house out. Well one of the panels was slightly warped so to straighten it I was going to hot glue a timber brace in the right spot to make it true. <BR>Well the phone rang so I went inside, not realising I had left the hot glue gun on. Well while I was inside somehow my hot glue gun has managed to ignite some paper on my work bench, which in turn ignited a plastic container with acetone in it. The acetone ran onto the floor on fire and ignited the cover that was over the front of my Fiero. The rest is pretty obvious. I have lost my Fiero (they are going to write it off) and every single piece of my stage 2 body kit. I am really pissed off at present as my Fiero is under insured by several thousand dollars. <P>Anybody who has stage 2 pieces on order I am going to have to compensate their deposits out of my insurance claim, the least of my worries at present but I thought I best mention it before people stress out. <P>Man why this, why now. I have a fortune tied up in that car but there is just too many things damaged to feasibly repair it. Looks like I am going to go through weeks of insurance BS then have to start looking for another t-topped Fiero. I am still in shock. First the tumor now my baby is dead. The garage got cosmetic damage only. I am going to see if I can buy it back though to salvage some bits of my interior, motor and t-tops.  <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/fiero01.jpg"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/fiero02_1.jpg"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/fiero03.jpg"> <P><BR><P>------------------<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero/ausfiero1.gif">   <BR><A HREF="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero" TARGET=_blank>My Fiero</A> | <A HREF="http://www.fieroshop.com.au" TARGET=_blank>Fiero Accessories</A>||202.139.20.3||reg||8
