Z||000007||Raydar||09-11-2001||08:05 AM||||Aus,<P>Man, I'm sorry to hear that.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"> <BR>I sure wouldn't let them total it, though, unless it's to your advantage. Looks *very* repairable, from the pics.<P>Best,<P>------------------<BR>Raydar - aka Steve<BR><FONT SIZE="1"><BR>Black 88 Formula.<BR>Red 88 Duke coupe. "The Project" <BR>88 Formula parts car. "The Donor"<BR></FONT>||||reg||1
Z||000008||AusFiero||09-11-2001||08:21 AM||||Not as repairable as it looks cost wise... Fiero parts are expensive here. The interior is totalled, it melted mostly and the fabric is all singed (hard to see in the photos). Everything is the front is dead. The flames spread underneath and most lines and wiring is melted. All that is salvageable is the t-tops, a few interior pieces, the engine and back panels. The tail lights was sitting in front of the car and are melted also. The wheels also survived. Well I think they did, the backs did anyway.<P>But I am going to buy it back if I am at all allowed too. I wll buy another Fiero, strip this one back to the bare chassis and start again as it kinda has sentimental value now as the longest I have ever kept a car.<P>------------------<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero/ausfiero1.gif">   <BR><A HREF="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero" TARGET=_blank>My Fiero</A> | <A HREF="http://www.fieroshop.com.au" TARGET=_blank>Fiero Accessories</A>||202.139.20.3||reg||1
Z||000009||Jaygee79||09-11-2001||08:27 AM||||Oh that's horrible.  I hope you can get it back.||||reg||1
Z||000010||8Ball||09-11-2001||08:32 AM||||(edited for spelling, probably still missed a few)<P>Aus,<P>Man oh my gods,<BR>I am soo sorry to hear about this. It sounds like you have luck like mine and I wouldn't wish that on my worst enemy. But the car really does (from the pics) look like it could be repaired cheaply. But I am sure you would know better than most of us what is and isn't repairable. I am sorry you lost your molds as well. I know you are depending on your Fiero work to survive. I just hope this has not hurt you too badly. Just keep in mind you have ALOT of friends on this forum and any and all of us will do anything we can to help you out. I hope the ins co. doesn't try to cheat you. And best of luck. If I can do anything to help just let me know.<P>Randy<p>[This message has been edited by 8Ball (edited 09-11-2001).]||||reg||1
Z||000011||AusFiero||09-11-2001||09:03 AM||||well financially when it comes to body parts 8ball it has totalled me. Had I just left them at the glass guys none of this would have happened  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"> <BR>I will survive though... I have been through worse and will bounce back.||||reg||1
