Z||000023||artherd||09-12-2001||04:22 AM||||Hi Aus, if the frame's not bent, you can fix it  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  <P>I Fixed my almost-frame-bent (would have been a total loss if the cradle wasn't removable) Formula from a nasty side impact at over 45mph.  Wheel *exploded*, you know the rest.<P>I've got an interior coming out of my other Formula too, I am going to totally replace essentially everything.  Yours if we can make it happen.<P>This could be a chance to do the Fiero right from the ground up, I found out my silver car had been through a minor engine compartment fire at some time, and I am just replacing *everything*<P>Asside from being expensive, it's a LOT OF FUN!  I get to rebuild the car with quality of materials, parts, and to tollerances that GM has never *dreamed* of!<P>Best!<BR>Be.<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.cartsys.com/fiero/88ttop.jpg">  <BR>Ben Cannon<BR>88 Formula, T-top Metalic Red<BR>88 Formula, Silver<BR>87 Coupe, Metalic Red<BR>"Every Man Dies, not every man really Lives"<BR>                -Mel Gibson, "Braveheart"||||reg||1
Z||000024||Nashco||09-12-2001||05:45 AM||||Wow Aus, that totally sucks!  Well, we've got fiero parts galore on this side of the pond!  If you need anything you can't find or something has a much higher price there than here, just let us know!  I'm sure there are some things we can get here and ship for less money and hassle that you'll have getting it there somewhere.  Give us the word, I'm sure there are a lot of us that will support you with this!  We want to see you get back to your projects, so we'll help fix that car <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  Seriously though, I'm sorry for what happened, and I'm sure you'll get all the support you could want from us here.  Keep us updated on what you need and you can't get there, we'll start searching!<P>Bryce<BR>88 GT||||reg||1
