Z||000032||AusFiero||09-13-2001||05:21 AM||||Well when the insurance company decides what they are doing I will make a list of parts. They may fix it yet, but god it is going to smell if they do.<BR>I really hope they just write it off so I can just buy another Fiero and start again. I will buy that one back for parts because I have a lot of money tied up in it, particularly the mechanicals. <BR>But I have to wait until Monday now to see what they say.<P>------------------<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero/ausfiero1.gif">   <BR><A HREF="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero" TARGET=_blank>My Fiero</A> | <A HREF="http://www.fieroshop.com.au" TARGET=_blank>Fiero Accessories</A>||202.139.20.3||reg||1
